            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Systems and methods herein describe generating automatic reactions in an augmented reality messenger system. The claimed systems and methods generate a contextual trigger defining a set of conditions at a first computing device, detect at least one of the set of conditions has been satisfied, cause presentation of an augmented reality content item at a second computing device, generate a user reaction in response to the presentation of the augmented reality content item and transmit the user reaction to a first computing device.</p>
